# ==============================================================================
# JanSathi AI (जन साथी AI) — Client Environment Configuration Template
# ==============================================================================
# FORGE '26 — Theme 1: Civic Pulse
#
# IMPORTANT:
# - In local development: Copy to `.env` or leave blank to rely on Vite dev proxy.
#     cp .env.example .env
# - In production (e.g. Vercel): Set VITE_API_BASE_URL in your Vercel Project Settings.
# - NEVER put private server secrets (database URIs, JWT secrets) in client variables.
# ==============================================================================

# Backend API Base URL
# Development: Leave empty so Vite forwards requests from '/api' to 'http://localhost:5000'
# Production: Set to your public Render backend URL with the '/api' prefix:
#   Example: https://jansathi-api.onrender.com/api
VITE_API_BASE_URL=
